### Findings ###
1. Edge server (Netty 9090) binds to ::1 (IPv6 loopback only), NodePort 30010 unreachable from host
2. Edge server has no /healthz route
3. Valid JWT -> edge proxy to learning-java times out (upstream connection issue)
4. Auth (no-token/expired-JWT) correctly rejected with 401 at edge
5. JWKS, register, login all PASS via MVC NodePort 30009
